@@ -59,6 +59,7 @@ All notable changes to this project are listed here. The format is based on [Kee
 - Tablet and foldable layouts with a navigation rail and a two-column timers grid.
 - In-app Help guide with step-by-step sync and widget setup instructions.
 - Russian translations for the new widget theme, Help and small-widget texts.
+- Plan tab (new, between Timers and Settings) with two sub-tabs. **Road to max**: everything still missing before your whole village is maxed for its Town Hall (Builder Base for its Builder Hall), grouped into Builders, Laboratory, Pet House, Builder Base and Star Laboratory, with the time left on each item and in total, including buildings you have not built yet. Times are normal upgrade times (no potions, helpers or Gold Pass); supercharges, walls, hero equipment and crafted-defense modules are not counted. **Bedtime Lvl Up**: pick how long you will be away (6 to 12 h) and it suggests, for every builder, the lab and the pet house that is free or frees up before you wake, an upgrade that keeps it busy all night. Resources and building requirements are not checked. English and Russian.
 
 ### Fixed
 - Widget progress bars now follow the chosen theme: Clash keeps the original green, Dark and Light use their own fixed colours (and a fresh neutral look), and only Material You follows the phone's accent. Fixes unreadable dark-on-dark rows in Light.
